Z||000000||85ZainoGT||11-03-2001||10:35 AM||||Well last night me, and about 9 other people got together in Greenwood last night for the get together, thanks for all of you who did show up, or tried to at least(shame)..   We had a great time.. Pics will be posted after I get home from work... We had almost everyone show up... here were the people that attended...<P>1) 85ZAINOGT (I had a passenger)<BR>2) BOILERMAKER<BR>3*) BOILERMAKERS wife drove also  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>3) BENGAL4<BR>4) Indiana_resto_guy<BR>5) Dan (he had a passenger)<BR>6) gladiator (he also had a passenger)<BR>7) -=Shame=- ***<P>   So it turned out to be pretty successful and we will be planning another soon hopefully b4 weather gets to horrible!<P>  ANYWAYS, if you got pics, post them here, and mine will be up by tonight hopefully  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Paul Ventimiglia<BR>1985 White/Silver GT <BR>2.8L 4 Speed LOADED :)<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sigpic2529_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
