Z||000008||gladiator||11-04-2001||06:52 AM||||I just wanted you to know that I really enjoyed meeting you guys (& girls) last Friday. It was nice to finally meet some locals who are into Fieros. I haven't 'cruised' the strip since I was a teenager. Lots of fun but I was getting a little jealous every time the 3 of you would race and I just couldn't keep up. My car is such a slug. I gotta get a 3800 SC. Anyhow, I'm looking forward to meeting up with you again real soon.<BR>-Gary<P>P.S: Hooters is not a strip club, its a family restaurant. Don't beleve me? Just ask for a kids menu next time you go.LOL||||reg||1
Z||000009||85ZainoGT||11-04-2001||10:20 AM||||indy-resto -- lol.. yes im normal, somewhat  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.. I will get those pics the next time, I figured you had one of them coming to your house afterwards anyways  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>gladiator -- I will be in that same position soon... I am buying an 87 gt auto, that doesnt have the speed my current 85gt does... so maybe you and I can get our cars going just a bit faster together, to keep up with the others.. jus cheap things like, power pulleys, chip, torque converter(this would help us a lot of the line), poly dog bone, kn air filter, and a shift kit, im going to do those things, and I think that will get me back to where I was with my 85...||||reg||6
